title Vinyl: scrubbing the seek bar at the deck's own density (640x480, 11.3 px/mm) (a finger held at three quarters: 03:03), then a real drag from a quarter to three quarters of the bar and its release (the seek) (allow-small: the rows under 7 mm are warnings)
sizes 640x480
# the deck's own density (11.3 px/mm, the harness's default for 640x480): the approved layout's touch rows are 70 px
# there, under the 7 mm (79 px): allow-small reports them as warnings (the owner's rule R-4) instead of failing
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_SCRUB 0.75

wait 1200
shot 01-scrubbing
expect esc
expect text "03:03"
expect text "-1:01"
drag 0.25 0.653 0.75 0.653
wait 600
shot 02-after-drag
expect noquit
